{
  "camel_example": "aliyun ecs RebootInstances --region cn-hangzhou --RegionId 'cn-hangzhou' --InstanceId.1 'i-bp67acfmxazb4p0000'",
  "cmd_full_name": "ecs reboot-instances",
  "cmd_name": "reboot-instances",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Restarts one or more ECS instances. You can specify whether to force restart instances and set different batch operation modes",
  "description_zh": "本接口用于重启一台或多台ECS实例，支持您通过参数来选择是否强制重启和设置不同的批量操作模式",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun ecs reboot-instances --biz-region-id cn-hangzhou --instance-id i-bp67acfmxazb4p0000 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": false,
  "name": "RebootInstances",
  "operation": {
    "action": "RebootInstances",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2014-05-26",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "readAndWrite",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "update",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "false",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to perform only a dry run. Valid values:\n\ntrue: performs only a dry run without restarting the instance. The system checks the required parameters, request format, and instance status. If the check fails, the corresponding error is returned. If the check passes, `DRYRUN.SUCCESS` is returned.\nIf the BatchOptimization parameter is set to `SuccessFirst`, the dry run result for `DryRun=true` returns only `DRYRUN.SUCCESS`.\n\nfalse: performs a dry run and sends the request. After the check passes, the instance is restarted.\n\nDefault value: false",
      "help_zh": "是否只预检此次请求。取值范围：\n\ntrue：发送检查请求，不会重启实例。检查项包括是否填写了必需参数、请求格式、实例状态。如果检查不通过，则返回对应错误。如果检查通过，则返回`DRYRUN.SUCCESS`。\n如果参数`BatchOptimization`被设置为`SuccessFirst`，对应的`DryRun=true`的预检结果只会返回`DRYRUN.SUCCESS`。\n\nfalse：发送正常请求，通过检查后直接重启实例。\n\n默认值：false",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "dry_run",
      "options": [
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DryRun",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    },
    {
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
      "help_en": "The region ID of the instance. You can call https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html to query the most recent region list",
      "help_zh": "实例所在的地域。您可以调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html查看最新的阿里云地域列表",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "region_id",
      "options": [
        "--biz-region-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RegionId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "false",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to force restart the instance. Valid values:\n\ntrue: forces a restart. This is equivalent to a power-off operation. Cached data that has not been written to storage devices is lost.\n\nfalse: performs a normal restart.\n\nDefault value: false",
      "help_zh": "是否强制重启。取值范围：\n\ntrue：强制重启。相当于典型的断电操作，所有未写入存储设备的缓存数据会丢失。\n\nfalse：正常重启。\n\n默认值：false",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "force_reboot",
      "options": [
        "--force-reboot"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ForceReboot",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    },
    {
      "example": "AllTogether",
      "help_en": "The batch operation mode. Valid values:\n\nAllTogether: In this mode, a success message is returned if all instances are restarted. If any instance fails validation, all instances fail to restart and an error message is returned.\n\nSuccessFirst: In this mode, each instance is restarted separately. The response includes the operation result for each instance.\n\nDefault value: AllTogether",
      "help_zh": "设置批量操作模式。取值范围：\n\nAllTogether：该模式下，如果实例全部重启成功，则返回成功信息；如果任意一个实例校验不通过，则所有实例重启失败，并返回失败信息。\n\nSuccessFirst：该模式下，分别重启每个实例，返回结果包含每个实例的操作结果信息。\n\n默认值：AllTogether",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "batch_optimization",
      "options": [
        "--batch-optimization"
      ],
      "raw_name": "BatchOptimization",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "element": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "example": "i-bp67acfmxazb4p****",
      "help_en": "The instance ID array. Array length: 1 to 100",
      "help_zh": "实例ID数组。数组长度：1~100",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "instance_id",
      "options": [
        "--instance-id"
      ],
      "param_style": "repeatList",
      "raw_name": "InstanceId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "array"
    }
  ],
